meta {
  name: Add Comment
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}/comments
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "content": "This itinerary looks great! @john what do you think about the timing?",
    "entity_type": "day",
    "entity_id": 5,
    "parent_id": null
  }
}

docs {
  # Add Comment

  Add a comment to a trip or trip entity (day, accommodation, activity, etc.).

  **Permission Required:** Viewer or higher

  **Request Body:**
  - `content` (required): Comment text (supports @username mentions)
  - `entity_type` (optional): Type of entity being commented on (day, accommodation, activity, booking, etc.)
  - `entity_id` (optional): ID of the entity being commented on
  - `parent_id` (optional): ID of parent comment (for nested replies)

  **Notes:**
  - Automatically detects @username mentions and stores user IDs
  - Supports nested comment threads via parent_id
  - If entity_type/entity_id not provided, comment is on the trip itself
  - Creates an activity log entry
  - Mentioned users can be notified (future feature)
}
